---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---
<section id="factor" class="factor-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">
        <Icon name="lucide:zap" class="title-icon" /> 
        JZAP Factor
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">How we turn abstract ideas into strategic decisions for your project.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="factor-grid">
      <div class="card factor-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <Icon name="lucide:compass" class="card-icon" />
          <h3 class="card-title">Strategic Clarity</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="card-text">We don't just say "yes, we can do it" at first request. Instead, we listen carefully, analyze thoroughly, and align technically before acting. Every decision is based on a deep understanding of your goals.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card factor-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <Icon name="lucide:brain" class="card-icon" />
          <h3 class="card-title">Abstract Thinking</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="card-text">We approach challenges through a layered, abstract lens — distilling complex needs into structured solutions, models, or scalable systems. This mindset helps us see what others miss.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card factor-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <Icon name="lucide:blocks" class="card-icon" />
          <h3 class="card-title">Architectural Mindset</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="card-text">Every idea is treated like a system. We design and improve software with long-term structure, scalability, and clarity in mind — building reliable foundations, not technical debt.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card factor-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <Icon name="lucide:pen-tool" class="card-icon" />
          <h3 class="card-title">Design as Leverage</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="card-text">We treat design not as decoration, but as strategic advantage — crafting interfaces, flows, and user experiences that support usability, perception, and long-term impact.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card factor-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <Icon name="lucide:life-buoy" class="card-icon" />
          <h3 class="card-title">Proactive Support</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="card-text">Like a true support role, we anticipate issues, cover weak spots, and boost performance at the right moment. Our presence ensures stability, growth, and fast recovery when needed most.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .factor-section {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
    min-height: 50vh;
  }
  

  
  .title-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    color: var(--electric-flash);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(160, 35, 200, 0.6));
  }
  


  .factor-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  
  .factor-grid > .card {
    width: calc(33.333% - (var(--spacing-lg) * 2 / 3));
    min-width: 300px;
  }
  
  .factor-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--surface-container), var(--surface-container-lowest));
    border: 1px solid var(--surface-container-high);
  }
  
  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface-container-high);
  }
  
  .card-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  
  .card-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--on-surface);
  }
  
  .card-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .factor-grid > .card {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
